Comment: Original implementation. The certbot Authenticator contract
 (add_parser_arguments/_setup_credentials/_perform/_cleanup) follows
 the same shape used by the unmaintained hsmade/certbot_dns_transip
 (Apache-2.0) and by certbot's own official DNS plugins - this is the
 standard, documented certbot.plugins.dns_common.DNSAuthenticator
 integration pattern, not code copied from that project. All TransIP
 API access goes through the separate python3-transip-rest package;
 see its own debian/copyright for the provenance of that code.

